                        \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\sqrt[3]{5x-10}=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}" 13194139533810 true] [17592186252859 1113 #uuid "5218dee8-10b1-5da3-9a22-e4d729ae555c" 13194139533810 true] [17592186252859 1145 "Let $k(x)=\\sqrt[3]{5x-10}.$ Let's sketch the graph of $y=k(x):$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13946716/assets/fee4cee6127ed4c12bc3c68260a6c21917734a44b60273448e68dd832270b0e5.png)\n\nThe graph shows that the function increases without bound as $x$ increases. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }k(x)=\\infty .\n$$" 13194139533810 true] [17592186252860 1000 #edb/ref 17592186252861 13194139533810 true] [17592186252860 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533810 true] [17592186252860 1041 "field-1" 13194139533810 true] [17592186252860 1104 #edb/ref 17592186252861 13194139533810 true] [17592186252860 1110 #uuid "b349c41c-0a07-59f7-8be0-8560e0bf0b96" 13194139533810 true] [17592186252861 1034 "\\infty" 13194139533810 true] [17592186252861 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533810 true] [17592186252861 1111 #uuid "d8588843-daf7-5a6f-8314-235104a07d1e" 13194139533810 true] [17592186252862 1017 #edb/ref 17592186252863 13194139533810 true] [17592186252862 1089 "q-167564" 13194139533810 true] [17592186252862 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533810 true] [17592186252862 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13946716/assets/4115f50e563758109358ebde96c41dd7674c9a17e3f0040